msgid "Maps L4/R4 to Steam Input (requires L4/R4 as HHD in Wincontrols tab). If disabled, they are keyboard buttons. Menu/L4/R4 can be combos: Menu is single-press QAM, double HHD, hold Xbox. L4/R4 are single-press QAM, hold HHD (legacy). "
